  "description": "What: CE-4649 (bows BW-8, R-4269) - an archer fires from horseback. On the farm terrain a 'War horse' (TKB 704, fearless) carries an 'Rider archer' (Friend, TKB 2013, a bow) in its saddle - a firing seat - and gallops east along y = 160 from x 0 to x 260 at 12 m/s, passing two men 25 m off its line ('Target 1', 'Target 2', Hostile, hold fire); the archer is ORDERED to shoot Target 1 (FireAtTarget). A bow fires on the move (BW-8: as any held weapon). Judge: (1) the horse gallops (over 8 m/s) (2) the archer shoots from the saddle (3) an arrow hits a target (4) the archer is still in the saddle at the end. Fail: the archer waits for the horse to stop. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh bw-mounted-archers"
 },
